(see LICENSE-MangaTranslator in this directory).

Copied from upstream commit e347a09 ("chore(ui): increase config status message display
duration to 6s"):
  core/            -> mangatl/core/
  utils/           -> mangatl/utils/   (without update_checker.py)
  main.py          -> mangatl/cli.py
The Gradio web UI (app.py, ui/), tests and docs were not copied.

Modifications by this project: imports moved under the `mangatl` package, the file log
written to <repo>/logs, and further changes recorded in this repository's git history.

core/ml/hi_sam/ contains code vendored by MangaTranslator from Hi-SAM
(https://github.com/ymy-k/Hi-SAM, Apache-2.0), which in turn includes code from Meta's
Segment Anything (Apache-2.0); see the headers of those files.
